        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. The VTR-265-M is a Texas DMV form for vehicle title liens, processed by TxDMV. A mechanics lien under Tex. Prop. Code Ch. 53 is completely different — it applies to real property (land and buildings), not vehicles."
